{
  "name": "02 · Tia: AI order assistant (Instagram, WhatsApp, website)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Tia, the 24/7 order assistant\n- **Gemini** classifies intent and extracts slots (size, flavour, date, Lagos area, guests, name, phone). Understands Pidgin.\n- **Handoff rules run before any reply**: complaints, discounts, 'talk to Temmie', wedding cakes, orders over ₦500k.\n- **Claude** writes the reply in Temmie's voice using ONLY the price book, knowledge base and live capacity.\n- A guardrail checks prices and promises before sending.\n- When all slots are filled, the order goes to intake (01).",
        "width": 680,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
